cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: >-
  Cite this research collection using its exact Git commit, and cite the original
  papers for their scientific results. These are analytical working notes and
  symbolic checks, not a peer-reviewed manuscript or a new Love-number theorem.
title: 'Kerr Tidal Response Theory: proof reconstruction'
authors:
  - family-names: Athota
    given-names: Venkata Hemanth
    email: bharadwaj.hemanth.002@gmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/heyyymonth/kerr-tidal-response-theory'
url: 'https://github.com/heyyymonth/kerr-tidal-response-theory'
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Analytical notes and reproducible symbolic checks of the stationary
  axisymmetric Ernst equation, a conditional mixed-quadrupole curvature
  obstruction, and explicit linear and mixed constructions through spin squared
  for declared mathematical boundary data, with a subtraction-dependent radial
  connection coefficient. The independently matched physical quadrupole-hexadecapole
  response remains uncomputed.
keywords:
  - general relativity
  - Kerr black holes
  - tidal response
  - symbolic verification
